    "keys": "Public Ed25519 keys as raw 32 bytes in hexadecimal. Both are published test-vector keys of the repository's fixtures; no private key is part of this pack.",
    "key_identity": "The key identity is 'ed25519:' followed by the lowercase SHA-256 of the raw 32-byte public key.",
    "scope_digest": "The scope of a group statement is {content_digest, claim_ids sorted by UTF-16 code units}; of a root-control statement {content_digest, purpose}. The digest is 'sha256:' and the SHA-256 of the scope's RFC 8785 bytes, given as scope_jcs_hex.",
    "envelopes": "envelope_hex is the complete detached envelope. Parse it with the limits given; either it is refused with expect.refusal, or the signed message (the domain prefix, one line feed and the statement's RFC 8785 bytes) is message_hex, the decoded 64-byte signature is signature_hex, and verification with the named key gives signature_valid.",
    "messages": "message_hex and signature_hex are verified directly with the named key; expect_valid is the result."
  },
